{"release":{"id":385967877,"tag":"0.5.0","author":"helloyongyang","name":"0.5.0","draft":false,"prerelease":false,"createdAt":"2026-09-10T02:32:11Z","publishedAt":"2026-09-10T02:36:26Z","markdown":"## LightX2V 0.5.0\r\n\r\nLightX2V provides efficient inference for a variety of video generation models, supporting text-to-video, image-to-video, and text-to-audio-video generation.\r\n\r\nThanks to all contributors and community members for your support!","html":"<div class=\"markdown-heading\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\">LightX2V 0.5.0</h2><a id=\"user-content-lightx2v-050\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: LightX2V 0.5.0\" href=\"#lightx2v-050\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\"></span></a></div>\n<p>LightX2V provides efficient inference for a variety of video generation models, supporting text-to-video, image-to-video, and text-to-audio-video generation.</p>\n<p>Thanks to all contributors and community members for your support!</p>\n","assets":[]}}